              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Short bow and sword. May have light armour (+2 pts), buckler (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Alternatively Combined Formation: may be included in a unit of spearmen of the same origin. (Armies of Antiquity p.33)</characteristic>
