                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Unarmed mahout and two crew armed with a thrusting spear, short bow and hand weapons. Elephant: may stampede; causes fear in infantry and terror in cavalry. One elephant per 1,000 points in the army. (Armies of Antiquity p.33)</characteristic>
