            <profile id="04aa-b18a-26a5-efea" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Incendiary projectiles and hand weapon. Light Infantry. Naffatun must be incorporated into units of light infantry (archers or auxiliary); a maximum of two may be included in each light infantry unit and must be placed in the front rank (not enforced; take them as a separate unit of one or two and combine on the table). Naffatun cause terror, but not until they have launched their projectiles for the first time in a battle. Projectiles: range as javelins (max 8"), Strength 8. (Armies of Antiquity p.33)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="20"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
